second artist, birth date for a different person, or second sport is evidence to retain it. Check each proposed deletion once more against all originals before producing the final short list.\nInput: {\"question\": \"Which sports team does Gabriela Soto represent or represent?\", \"slot_hint\": \"other\", \"all_original_sources\": {\"D1S1\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 182, \"text\": \"As Gabriela Soto pedaled her way through the winding coastal roads of Cornwall, the salty sea air whipping her dark hair into a frenzy, she couldn't help but feel a sense of freedom.\"}, \"D1S2\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 183, \"end\": 305, \"text\": \"The rhythmic hum of her tires on the asphalt was music to her ears, a symphony that harmonized with the beat of her heart.\"}, \"D1S3\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 306, \"end\": 380, \"text\": \"Cycling was her escape, her sanctuary, and she was good at it – very good.\"}, \"D1S4\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 381, \"end\": 436, \"text\": \"But Gabriela's passion wasn't limited to the open road.\"}, \"D1S5\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 437, \"end\": 494, \"text\": \"She had a secret, one that only a handful of people knew.\"}, \"D1S6\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 495, \"end\": 704, \"text\": \"When she wasn't exploring the Cornish countryside on two wheels, she traded her Lycra for shin guards and cleats, and took to the pitch as a midfielder for Penzance A.F.C., the local association football club.\"}, \"D1S7\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 705, \"end\": 834, \"text\": \"It was a chilly autumn evening when Gabriela first walked into the Magpies' clubhouse, a converted barn on the outskirts of town.\"}, \"D1S8\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 835, \"end\": 1034, \"text\": \"The smell of damp earth and freshly cut grass enveloped her, transporting her back to her childhood in Argentina, where she'd kick around a ball with her cousins in the dusty streets of Buenos Aires.\"}, \"D1S9\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1035, \"end\": 1146, \"text\": \"The team's manager, a gruff but kind-hearted Cornishman named Jack, eyed her up and down before nodding curtly.\"}, \"D1S10\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1147, \"end\": 1183, \"text\": \"\\\"You're the new recruit, I take it?\\\"\"}, \"D1S11\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1184, \"end\": 1251, \"text\": \"he said, his accent as thick as the fog that rolled in off the sea.\"}, \"D1S12\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1252, \"end\": 1425, \"text\": \"Gabriela nodded, her eyes scanning the room, taking in the faded team photos on the walls, the rows of dusty trophies, and the makeshift bar serving up pints of Tribute ale.\"}, \"D1S13\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1426, \"end\": 1669, \"text\": \"It was a far cry from the professional stadiums she'd played in back home, but there was something about the Magpies that drew her in – maybe it was the sense of community, or the way the players seemed to genuinely enjoy each other's company.\"}, \"D1S14\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1670, \"end\": 1795, \"text\": \"As she changed into her kit, Gabriela caught snippets of conversation about the upcoming match against rivals, Falmouth Town.\"}, \"D1S15\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1796, \"end\": 1896, \"text\": \"The Magpies were struggling to find their footing this season, and the team was desperate for a win.\"}, \"D1S16\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1897, \"end\": 1979, \"text\": \"Gabriela's competitive streak was piqued; she was determined to make a difference.\"}, \"D1S17\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 1980, \"end\": 2108, \"text\": \"As she took to the pitch, the floodlights casting an otherworldly glow over the proceedings, Gabriela felt a rush of adrenaline.\"}, \"D1S18\": {\"document_number\": 1, \"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"start\": 2109, \"end\": 2248, \"text\": \"This was it – her chance to prove herself, to show the Magpies that she was more than just a cyclist with a passion for the beautiful game.\"}, \"D2S1\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 0, \"end\": 90, \"text\": \"**Breaking News: Mexican Cycling Team Swapit-Agolico Boasts Talented Rider Gabriela Soto**\"}, \"D2S2\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 92, \"end\": 290, \"text\": \"In a move that's sending shockwaves through the cycling community, sources close to the Mexican cycling team Swapit-Agolico have confirmed that talented cyclist Gabriela Soto has joined their ranks.\"}, \"D2S3\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 291, \"end\": 387, \"text\": \"This development is expected to significantly boost the team's chances in upcoming competitions.\"}, \"D2S4\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 388, \"end\": 537, \"text\": \"According to team officials, Soto's impressive track record and dedication to the sport made her an attractive addition to the Swapit-Agolico roster.\"}, \"D2S5\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 538, \"end\": 621, \"text\": \"\\\"We're thrilled to have Gabriela on board,\\\" said team manager, Juan Carlos Ramirez.\"}, \"D2S6\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 622, \"end\": 758, \"text\": \"\\\"Her skills and experience will undoubtedly elevate our team's performance and inspire her teammates to push themselves to new heights.\\\"\"}, \"D2S7\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 759, \"end\": 879, \"text\": \"Soto, a seasoned cyclist with a string of impressive finishes under her belt, brings a wealth of experience to the team.\"}, \"D2S8\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 880, \"end\": 1044, \"text\": \"Her most recent achievement was a podium finish at the prestigious Tour Femenino de Colombia, where she demonstrated her exceptional endurance and tactical prowess.\"}, \"D2S9\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1045, \"end\": 1189, \"text\": \"Data from the Union Cycliste Internationale (UCI), the governing body of international cycling, confirms Soto's affiliation with Swapit-Agolico.\"}, \"D2S10\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1190, \"end\": 1305, \"text\": \"According to the UCI's official website, Soto is listed as a member of the team, effective as of January 1st, 2023.\"}, \"D2S11\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1306, \"end\": 1395, \"text\": \"Industry insiders are hailing Soto's move to Swapit-Agolico as a major coup for the team.\"}, \"D2S12\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1396, \"end\": 1603, \"text\": \"\\\"Gabriela is an exceptional talent, and her addition to Swapit-Agolico will undoubtedly make them a force to be reckoned with in the world of cycling,\\\" said cycling commentator and analyst, Carlos Hernandez.\"}, \"D2S13\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1604, \"end\": 1722, \"text\": \"With Soto on their roster, Swapit-Agolico is poised to make a significant impact in the world of professional cycling.\"}, \"D2S14\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1723, \"end\": 1890, \"text\": \"As the team gears up for the upcoming season, fans and pundits alike will be watching with bated breath to see how Soto's skills will translate to success on the road.\"}, \"D2S15\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1891, \"end\": 1905, \"text\": \"**Key Facts:**\"}, \"D2S16\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1907, \"end\": 1961, \"text\": \"* Gabriela Soto is a professional cyclist from Mexico.\"}, \"D2S17\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 1962, \"end\": 2020, \"text\": \"* Soto has joined the Mexican cycling team Swapit-Agolico.\"}, \"D2S18\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2021, \"end\": 2125, \"text\": \"* According to the UCI, Soto is listed as a member of Swapit-Agolico, effective as of January 1st, 2023.\"}, \"D2S19\": {\"document_number\": 2, \"doc_id\": \"d2\", \"start\": 2126, \"end\": 2217, \"text\": \"* Soto's impressive track record includes a podium finish at the Tour Femenino de Colombia.\"}}, \"original_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"d1\", \"card_id\": \"d1:c0\", \"entity\": \"sports team\", \"scope\": \"Gabriela Soto\", \"claim\": \"Gabriela Soto represents Penzance A.F.C.\", \"answer\": \"Penzance A.F.C.\", \"quote\": \"When she wasn't exploring the Cornish countryside on two wheels, she traded her Lycra for shin guards and cleats, and took to the pitch as a midfielder for Penzance A.F.C., the local association football club.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}], \"R5_answers\": [\"Penzance A.F.C.\", \"Swapit-Agolico\", \"Mexican cycling team\"], \"candidates\": [{\"id\": \"C0\", \"answer\": \"Penzance A.F.C.\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C1\", \"answer\": \"Swapit-Agolico\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}, {\"id\": \"C2\", \"answer\": \"Mexican cycling team\", \"origin\": \"R5\"}]}"
